cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "res-asset-kpi: key performance indicators for operating PV, wind and battery assets"
abstract: >-
  A Python library of key performance indicators for operating renewable assets: performance ratio,
  temperature-corrected and weather-corrected PR, availability and a budget-to-actual energy bridge for PV
  plants; availability by IEC 61400-26 categories, power curves by the method of bins and reliability
  indicators (MTBF, MTTR, Crow-AMSAA) for wind turbines; state-of-charge-corrected round-trip efficiency,
  LTSA availability, rainflow cycles and capacity tests with uncertainty for battery storage; and contract
  guarantees and liquidated damages in YAML. Implemented from public descriptions of the standards; not a
  certified implementation.
